{"about_the_game":"Wurmus is a non-traditional snake-like which rewards creative movement, spatial awareness, and risk management. It's best experienced with a gamepad and headphones.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A different breed of Snake</h2>Outrun, outsmart, and eat your opponents. Move backwards, strafe sideways, and turn freely. Collect power-ups which taunt, instill fear, and grant stability.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your high score</h2>Earn points for captures and longevity. Purposely lose encounters\u2014and manage the ensuing chaos\u2014to pad your highest score yet.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An accessible experience</h2>Wurmus provides high visual contrast, binaural audio cues, and screen reader support. Its graphics can be toggled off to be enjoyed with audio alone.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2589100?t=1770702787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2589100?t=1770702787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770702787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770702787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Wurmus is a non-traditional snake-like which rewards creative movement, spatial awareness, and risk management. It's best experienced with a gamepad and headphones.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A different breed of Snake</h2>Outrun, outsmart, and eat your opponents. Move backwards, strafe sideways, and turn freely. Collect power-